00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:18,480
My name is Qi Miao

13
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:21,080
An insignificant screenwriter

14
00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:23,280
Just like my name suggests

15
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:25,160
For the past twenty-five years

16
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:27,200
My life has been filled with

17
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:28,960
Wonderful and miraculous things

18
00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:32,280
Such a lovely day today

19
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,320
Life will always treat kindly

20
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,800
Every girl who loves to smile

21
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:41,040
That's why I keep an optimistic mindset every day

22
00:01:41,080 --> 00:01:42,240
And face life positively

23
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:44,960
I believe

24
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:46,600
As long as your heart is filled with sunshine

25
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:48,480
Life will never let you down

26
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,440
Because light will shine through your windows

27
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:52,320
And accompany you anywhere

28
00:01:58,920 --> 00:01:59,680
Keep running forward

29
00:01:59,720 --> 00:02:01,280
As long as you stay positive in life

30
00:02:01,440 --> 00:02:03,160
Even if your shoes wear out

31
00:02:03,240 --> 00:02:05,480
Even if the road is too crowded

32
00:02:10,040 --> 00:02:12,280
Good luck will still be with you

33
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:15,320
Life is full of surprises

34
00:02:15,799 --> 00:02:16,760
Surprise, my foot!

35
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:17,920
That's not how it is at all

36
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:23,960
My name is Qi Miao

37
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:25,240
Just like my name

38
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:27,120
My life is always accompanied by

39
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:29,120
Bizarre and inexplicable events

40
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:33,920
In the past twenty-five years

41
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,600
There have been no pleasant surprises in my life

42
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:36,760
Only countless accidents

43
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:41,480
That's right

44
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,240
This is me

45
00:02:42,320 --> 00:02:44,760
A person blessed with the so-called unfortunate physique

46
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:46,360
I can't take it anymore

47
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:09,480
Another Mercury retrograde day

48
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:10,040
Sis,

49
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:20,880
Qi Dongdong,

50
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:22,040
my half-brother.

51
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:23,360
An unemployed freeloader.

52
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:24,000
Tried starting a business 100 times,

53
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:25,320
failed 100 times.

54
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:25,960
Sis,

55
00:03:26,040 --> 00:03:27,080
are you okay?

56
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:28,360
Qi Dongdong,

57
00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:29,560
you’re never home these days.

58
00:03:29,600 --> 00:03:30,560
Where have you been?

59
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:32,400
Sis, I’ve found a new business opportunity!

60
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:33,600
This time, success is guaranteed.

61
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,400
Stop right there!

62
00:03:35,240 --> 00:03:36,480
The rent is due today.

63
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:38,200
What about the living allowance Dad gave you?

64
00:03:39,680 --> 00:03:40,120
Sis,

65
00:03:42,480 --> 00:03:43,480
look at these jade stones.

66
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:45,520
I worked super hard to find them.

67
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:46,960
They’re bound to fetch a great price!

68
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:47,800
Wait a minute.

69
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:49,960
Don’t tell me,

70
00:03:50,040 --> 00:03:51,880
you spent the rent money on these worthless stones!

71
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:54,080
What do you mean 'worthless stones'?

72
00:03:54,480 --> 00:03:55,640
These are top-quality jade!

73
00:03:55,720 --> 00:03:56,560
Alright, alright, enough already.

74
00:03:57,040 --> 00:03:58,240
I don’t have time to argue with you.

75
00:03:58,320 --> 00:03:59,200
I’m running late.

76
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:01,760
You must get the rent money back today.

77
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:02,600
Or else,

78
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:04,440
you’ll see how I deal with you when I get back.

79
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,520
Not an ounce of business sense!

80
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:11,680
Wait,

81
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:14,880
wait, wait, wait!

82
00:04:19,920 --> 00:04:21,720
Why can’t a single day go smoothly?

83
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:12,680
Omega Staff,

84
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:21,080
being a minute late.

85
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:26,000
Qi Miao, you’re late again.

86
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:29,920
Wait, wait!

87
00:05:30,520 --> 00:05:32,120
You’ve already used up your three chances this month.

88
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:33,360
200 yuan will be deducted from your wages.

89
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:33,960
Wait,

90
00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:35,800
I was only one minute late!

91
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:36,880
Give me another chance—

92
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:37,960
just bend the rules a little.

93
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:38,720
Mr. Jiang is looking for you.

94
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:39,200
Hurry up!

95
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,240
Don't get in the way of my work.

96
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:43,040
Full attack mode!

97
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:44,680
All you do is play games.

98
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:47,560
Lose every day, lose every day.

99
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:50,680
Teacher Jiang.

100
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:58,440
Oh, Xiao Jiang.

101
00:05:58,760 --> 00:05:59,520
Please send me the files as soon as possible.

102
00:06:00,880 --> 00:06:01,640
Okay, Manager Wang.

103
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:08,240
Take a seat.

104
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:14,200
Teacher Jiang.

105
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:15,280
What do you need from me?

106
00:06:16,880 --> 00:06:17,520
Qi Miao.

107
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:19,600
After the company's decision,

108
00:06:19,760 --> 00:06:21,040
you won't need to follow up on the 'Sweet Strike' project anymore.

109
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,400
You don't need to follow anymore in the future.

110
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:23,440
The production side

111
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:25,560
has arranged for a more suitable writer to take over.

112
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:28,200
But I've been involved with this project from the beginning.

113
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:30,400
The entire concept was mine.

114
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:31,120
Qi Miao.

115
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:32,160
Some things

116
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,960
aren't about who's responsible or not.

117
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:36,240
Remember, we are a team.

118
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,200
But—

119
00:06:37,280 --> 00:06:38,080
Enough.

120
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:40,080
I understand how you feel.

121
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:41,320
When I first entered the industry,

122
00:06:41,400 --> 00:06:42,480
I went through the same thing.

123
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:44,280
Regardless of whose name it carries,

124
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,680
it's still our company's work, right?

125
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:47,480
Then,

126
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:49,040
what about the project bonus?

127
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,240
Will it be issued on time today?

128
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:52,680
The production side still has some paperwork to finalize.

129
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:53,600
You'll just have to wait a bit longer.

130
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:55,200
I've already been waiting six months.

131
00:06:55,280 --> 00:06:56,000
Qi Miao.

132
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:57,640
You're currently

133
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:59,560
a screenwriter in your rising phase.

134
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:01,640
Stop focusing on small gains.

135
00:07:01,960 --> 00:07:03,280
If there's nothing else, you can leave now.

136
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,480
And next time you enter the office,

137
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:14,160
remember to knock.

138
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:19,640
Close the door.

139
00:07:26,400 --> 00:07:27,200
Every single day...

140
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:28,840
What kind of nonsense is this?

141
00:07:31,400 --> 00:07:32,160
Hey, Qi.

142
00:07:32,320 --> 00:07:33,520
Hurry up and pay me the rent!

143
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:35,000
If you don't, get out!

144
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,760
When will days like this ever end?

145
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:46,040
Seriously, when?

146
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:51,920
Hello, Mr. Wang.

147
00:07:52,160 --> 00:07:53,200
This is Xiao Qi.

148
00:07:53,320 --> 00:07:55,120
We just met this morning.

149
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:56,840
I just wanted to ask if I could get an advance on

150
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:58,160
my salary for the second half of the year.

151
00:07:59,640 --> 00:08:00,200
Hello?

152
00:08:01,280 --> 00:08:01,880
Mr. Wang?

153
00:08:02,520 --> 00:08:03,160
Mr. Wang?

154
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:10,760
It's that person...

155
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:13,640
Where am I supposed to find money for rent now?
